WEBVTT

00:10.566 --> 00:11.450
Where are you going?

00:11.760 --> 00:13.199
Khao Yai!

00:13.519 --> 00:14.721
I just want to be with you.

00:14.947 --> 00:17.968
Even though you'll get back with Jeen tomorrow,

00:18.001 --> 00:20.012
I'll still be happy for today anyway.

00:20.666 --> 00:22.414
So, you posted those pics...

00:22.827 --> 00:24.024
just to get people to like you?

00:24.437 --> 00:26.871
If that's all you want,
you can deactivate your account.

00:27.129 --> 00:28.172
I can do it for you.

00:29.594 --> 00:30.355
Where is Tee?

00:30.990 --> 00:32.113
Hey, is he over there?

00:33.901 --> 00:35.436
Tee!

00:37.127 --> 00:38.146
Fuse!

00:38.492 --> 00:39.680
Hey!

00:54.600 --> 00:56.626
Tee!

00:56.987 --> 00:58.099
Tee, are you okay?

00:59.183 --> 01:00.927
You good? Are you okay?

01:02.466 --> 01:03.666
Tee, you okay?

01:05.066 --> 01:05.866
I'm okay.

01:07.239 --> 01:08.972
I'm just practicing diving.

01:09.393 --> 01:10.193
Oh.

01:11.966 --> 01:13.266
You totally scared me.

01:19.652 --> 01:20.819
Are you worried about me?

01:30.338 --> 01:33.132
We'll leave then. Bye.

01:42.013 --> 01:43.679
Don't play like this again.

01:51.073 --> 01:51.873
Okay.

04:18.286 --> 04:19.219
I'm sorry.

04:30.253 --> 04:31.419
Why are you apologizing?

04:33.419 --> 04:35.119
For frightening you.

04:36.419 --> 04:37.519
Are you mad at me?

04:40.953 --> 04:42.019
I'm not mad at you.

04:44.258 --> 04:45.892
I'm just letting my mind wander.

04:59.619 --> 05:00.886
When you disappeared,

05:01.419 --> 05:02.619
I was so shocked.

05:04.019 --> 05:06.119
And even more so when you're drowning.

05:08.906 --> 05:09.706
I...

05:12.599 --> 05:14.932
I only thought that I had to save you.

05:16.486 --> 05:17.453
You must be fine.

05:20.832 --> 05:23.466
If not, I'll...

05:30.253 --> 05:31.286
I'm here.

05:34.959 --> 05:35.826
I'm fine.

05:41.753 --> 05:42.953
I already told you.

05:45.819 --> 05:47.319
If you want me to stay,

05:48.086 --> 05:48.919
I won't go anywhere.

05:53.686 --> 05:55.653
Will you stay with me forever then?

05:58.519 --> 05:59.319
Um.

06:34.753 --> 06:36.686
I brought you some snacks from Khao Yai.

06:39.319 --> 06:40.353
Did you go there?

06:41.419 --> 06:42.509
Didn't you see that?

06:42.509 --> 06:44.096
In his IG stories.

06:44.096 --> 06:46.019
His stories are a whole row of dots.

06:47.486 --> 06:48.319
Who did you go with?

06:49.019 --> 06:49.819
My family.

06:50.653 --> 06:51.419
You sure?

06:51.419 --> 06:52.219
Is that so?

06:52.619 --> 06:53.419
You sure?

06:54.086 --> 06:55.953
And Tee. Are you happy now?

07:00.432 --> 07:02.132
Are you that close to him?

07:02.428 --> 07:03.210
Yeah.

07:03.235 --> 07:06.403
I've known you since grade 1
but you never invite me to join your family trip.

07:06.479 --> 07:07.679
Because you're just a friend.

07:12.398 --> 07:13.991
What is Tee, then?

07:16.537 --> 07:18.933
I guess Tee is F...

07:20.393 --> 07:21.440
WB.

07:23.719 --> 07:25.286
FWB, my ass.

07:25.819 --> 07:26.985
Did you hide yourself under my bed?

07:27.078 --> 07:28.022
What do you mean?

07:28.492 --> 07:30.492
I mean friends with buffets.

07:34.666 --> 07:35.666
I also want to have one.

07:35.899 --> 07:37.266
You don't need to eat buffets.

07:37.399 --> 07:38.299
Just eat fish instead.

07:38.933 --> 07:39.899
Fish?

07:40.404 --> 07:41.204
This fish.

07:41.634 --> 07:43.634
Hey, guys.

07:46.879 --> 07:47.795
Up, up.

07:47.795 --> 07:48.475
Damn.

07:48.476 --> 07:50.476
Yay.

07:53.645 --> 07:54.676
Fuse.

07:54.947 --> 07:56.947
Hey, put me down.

08:00.593 --> 08:03.293
Guys, Fuse's FWB is here.

08:06.786 --> 08:07.586
Tee.

08:08.299 --> 08:09.399
Do you like buffets?

08:09.666 --> 08:10.633
Wit.

08:11.266 --> 08:12.663
What did you ask him?

08:12.885 --> 08:13.685
Huh?

08:13.832 --> 08:14.943
Why?

08:15.699 --> 08:16.866
Don't forget to have the snacks.

08:17.099 --> 08:17.899
I chose them myself.

08:17.933 --> 08:18.799
Hey, Tee.

08:19.133 --> 08:20.899
How was the Khao Yai trip with my friend?

08:20.924 --> 08:21.724
Do you enjoy?

08:23.533 --> 08:24.333
I do.

08:27.143 --> 08:28.686
Is my friend cute?

08:33.466 --> 08:34.266
He's cute.

08:39.482 --> 08:41.076
There you go.

08:41.162 --> 08:42.233
Look at these.

08:42.258 --> 08:43.956
They're exactly the same.

08:44.581 --> 08:46.581
They're the same one.

08:49.540 --> 08:50.365
Hey.

08:50.969 --> 08:52.399
By the way, on the Khao Yai trip...

08:52.572 --> 08:53.805
did you do the same thing
you did behind the building?

08:54.266 --> 08:54.968
Huh? What?

08:54.968 --> 08:55.383
What did they do?

08:55.408 --> 08:56.208
Behind the building?

08:56.599 --> 08:57.466
Hey, what did they do?

08:57.599 --> 08:58.499
Spill the tea.

08:58.524 --> 08:59.916
Behind the building,...

09:00.332 --> 09:02.583
I saw them together and then...

09:02.656 --> 09:03.769
Ouch.

09:04.057 --> 09:04.857
Oh.

09:05.099 --> 09:05.799
That's harsh.

09:05.799 --> 09:06.633
So harsh.

09:06.899 --> 09:08.299
Why is he acting like this?

09:09.144 --> 09:09.944
What's wrong with him?

09:14.392 --> 09:15.458
Go back to your seat.

09:16.625 --> 09:17.492
Fine.

09:17.517 --> 09:18.263
Okay.

09:40.330 --> 09:41.828
What did you just do?

09:45.528 --> 09:47.186
Why did you bring your bag?

09:52.070 --> 09:53.070
I move to different rooms for every class.

09:54.303 --> 09:56.196
Why aren't you in class yet?

09:56.744 --> 09:58.010
Why did you stop by my room?

09:58.649 --> 09:59.683
I just want to see you.

10:01.643 --> 10:02.843
If I'm bothering you,

10:03.543 --> 10:04.477
I'll leave.

10:06.390 --> 10:08.410
Um.

10:08.636 --> 10:10.636
Do you think you're cute when acting sulky?

10:16.530 --> 10:19.164
Wanna grab dinner this evening?

10:23.118 --> 10:23.918
Sure.

10:34.584 --> 10:35.618
You promised.

10:51.684 --> 10:53.643
Hey, Tee!

10:54.518 --> 10:55.396
Tee!

10:56.015 --> 10:57.564
We must go now.

11:02.984 --> 11:03.984
I have to go.

11:09.584 --> 11:10.584
Have a good day.

11:13.018 --> 11:13.818
Okay.

11:19.284 --> 11:20.318
See you this evening.

11:20.884 --> 11:21.684
Bye.

11:52.684 --> 11:54.018
Did you double-booked yourself?

11:56.651 --> 11:57.384
What?

11:57.384 --> 11:58.184
Ouch.

11:58.518 --> 12:01.118
Nai asked me to tell you that
you have a practice this evening.

12:04.918 --> 12:05.718
Huh?

12:08.251 --> 12:10.884
Wanna grab dinner this evening?

12:11.284 --> 12:12.218
You promised.

12:34.688 --> 12:35.488
Hey, wait.

12:36.200 --> 12:37.000
Yes?

12:38.643 --> 12:39.810
You have a practice today, don't you?

12:40.565 --> 12:42.521
Can I skip today's practice?

12:42.521 --> 12:44.031
Can I go to Siam with my friend?

12:44.448 --> 12:44.948
Why would you go there?

12:45.109 --> 12:46.342
I want to watch a movie.

12:47.587 --> 12:50.087
Don't even think about it, go back to practice.

12:55.510 --> 12:56.310
Come here.

12:57.689 --> 12:59.122
Hey, my shirt will tear.

13:00.413 --> 13:01.779
Take your drum major mace out

13:04.731 --> 13:05.798
It's too far.

13:09.207 --> 13:10.073
Take it out.

13:15.165 --> 13:16.798
If you came to practice more often,

13:17.079 --> 13:18.579
it wouldn't be kept so far.

13:44.315 --> 13:45.348
Are you okay?

13:46.052 --> 13:49.118
You are so careless.
What would you do if I weren't here?

13:51.169 --> 13:51.969
I'm sorry.

13:54.452 --> 13:55.252
Hey.

14:02.998 --> 14:03.798
Does it hurt?

14:13.629 --> 14:14.429
Where are you going?

14:15.137 --> 14:15.789
To practice.

14:16.136 --> 14:17.605
Why? Mhek is already there.

14:17.738 --> 14:19.372
Hey, I'm the leader of cheer club.

14:19.423 --> 14:20.368
Don't be stubborn.

14:21.152 --> 14:23.250
Look at your wound. Stay right here.

14:24.173 --> 14:25.969
Let me get you patched up.

14:28.623 --> 14:29.589
Can you do it?

14:30.130 --> 14:30.930
Easy peasy.

14:34.997 --> 14:36.130
First, remove the dust.

14:41.530 --> 14:43.464
Oh, isn't that too much?

14:44.430 --> 14:45.825
Of course.

14:46.615 --> 14:47.884
If you don't recover in time,

14:48.144 --> 14:49.502
what will you do?

14:50.052 --> 14:51.186
Let it get infected?

14:52.169 --> 14:53.909
That way, you can't drag me to practice.

14:55.536 --> 14:56.702
I still can drag you.

14:59.490 --> 15:00.480
Thank you.

15:01.323 --> 15:02.367
If it weren't for you,

15:02.392 --> 15:04.261
my head would be cracked open.

15:25.309 --> 15:26.743
Is there something on my face?

15:28.409 --> 15:29.209
No.

15:33.423 --> 15:36.523
You must clean the wound everyday,
so you'll recover soon.

15:37.735 --> 15:38.535
Um.

15:38.664 --> 15:40.299
One more thing.

15:41.104 --> 15:44.035
I think you should take a break.
I'm really worried about you.

15:46.516 --> 15:47.716
What if you slack off?

15:48.670 --> 15:50.103
I won't slack off. I promise.

16:10.583 --> 16:11.383
Rodtang.

16:17.103 --> 16:18.036
Thanks.

16:29.830 --> 16:30.630
Hey.

16:32.016 --> 16:33.116
Hurry up.

16:33.570 --> 16:34.570
What are you doing?

16:37.676 --> 16:38.476
Come on.

16:45.650 --> 16:47.483
Hey, Nai will see it.

16:49.290 --> 16:50.090
Damn.

16:55.080 --> 16:55.949
The big day is around the corner.

16:56.026 --> 16:56.704
You should practice.

16:59.159 --> 17:00.662
Uh...

17:00.696 --> 17:02.213
Your mace is over there.

17:03.266 --> 17:04.332
Someone already brought it.

17:21.848 --> 17:23.851
(Sorry, I have a practice.)

17:23.851 --> 17:27.068
(Let's do it another time.)

17:32.376 --> 17:36.010
(Sorry, I have a practice.)
(Let's do it another time.)

18:03.326 --> 18:04.126
Hey.

18:05.919 --> 18:06.753
Fuse.

18:08.812 --> 18:10.112
Are you the head drum major?

18:10.172 --> 18:11.338
Are you the assistant drum major?

18:12.519 --> 18:13.319
Um.

18:15.393 --> 18:17.026
If I knew it's you,

18:17.153 --> 18:18.686
I wouldn't skip any practice.

18:19.219 --> 18:20.019
Whoa.

18:20.953 --> 18:22.518
Let's practice.

18:22.518 --> 18:23.018
Hey.

18:23.253 --> 18:25.919
We must be the coolest
drum major in the school's history.

18:26.165 --> 18:26.965
Let's get it.

18:35.721 --> 18:36.854
You're really good at it.

18:37.054 --> 18:38.193
You can do everything I taught you.

18:38.580 --> 18:39.775
Hmm.

18:41.443 --> 18:42.277
I have a secret.

18:42.577 --> 18:43.177
What is it?

18:43.177 --> 18:44.119
Wanna know?

18:44.119 --> 18:44.619
Yeah.

18:46.143 --> 18:47.743
My IQ is 180.

18:48.377 --> 18:49.377
Maybe not.

18:50.804 --> 18:51.604
What?

18:52.590 --> 18:54.096
Come on.

18:59.206 --> 19:01.401
(I just finished my extra class. I'm coming.)

19:05.716 --> 19:07.050
Who are you talking to?

19:08.056 --> 19:08.856
Nothing.

19:09.349 --> 19:10.149
Just a peek.

19:17.016 --> 19:17.816
Hey.

19:25.801 --> 19:26.820
Hello, Tee.

19:38.143 --> 19:38.990
Nai, why are you here?

19:39.202 --> 19:39.783
What?

19:40.734 --> 19:41.826
You little brat.

19:45.949 --> 19:46.773
Hey.

19:46.773 --> 19:47.794
Don't.

19:49.476 --> 19:51.011
That's too tight.

19:51.231 --> 19:52.250
What's wrong with you?

19:53.244 --> 19:54.469
Hey.

19:54.494 --> 19:55.410
It's uncomfortable.

19:55.830 --> 19:57.270
You didn't look uncomfortable a moment ago.

19:57.295 --> 19:59.295
Did you finish the extra class?

20:00.549 --> 20:01.783
I also finished my practice.

20:01.983 --> 20:02.816
Let's grab something to eat.

20:03.409 --> 20:04.243
Can I join you two?

20:05.789 --> 20:06.623
Sure, let's go.

20:07.957 --> 20:09.024
Nai, will you come with us?

20:09.216 --> 20:10.783
Nai doesn't want to go. It's fine.

20:11.183 --> 20:11.983
I'll go.

20:12.449 --> 20:13.249
Don't go.

20:13.476 --> 20:14.476
He asked me.

20:15.216 --> 20:15.849
No need to go.

20:16.022 --> 20:17.122
Why would you go with us?

20:17.883 --> 20:18.749
Because he invited me.

20:19.483 --> 20:20.283
You don't have to go.

20:21.749 --> 20:22.549
He invited me.

20:23.583 --> 20:24.383
Just don't go.

20:25.049 --> 20:25.849
I'll go.

20:43.549 --> 20:44.983
Pizza delivery.

20:46.583 --> 20:47.483
I didn't order it.

20:48.949 --> 20:50.216
A promotion for today.

20:50.669 --> 20:51.469
Buy one, get one free.

20:52.169 --> 20:53.536
But if you are my boyfriend,

20:54.749 --> 20:55.616
you can have it for free.

20:58.776 --> 20:59.876
I don't want to eat it.

21:03.449 --> 21:04.249
What?

21:05.449 --> 21:07.349
So, what do you want to eat?

21:07.655 --> 21:08.555
I'll order it for you.

21:10.363 --> 21:11.196
I don't feel like eating.

21:12.836 --> 21:14.049
And I want to be alone.

21:15.936 --> 21:16.902
You can leave now.

21:22.616 --> 21:23.809
Okay, fine.

21:25.083 --> 21:28.216
Well, can you post any pic tonight?

21:28.669 --> 21:31.169
Just post anything, I'll be the first who like it.

21:31.249 --> 21:32.049
No.

21:35.869 --> 21:37.269
I won't post any more pictures.

21:42.783 --> 21:43.583
What?

21:44.283 --> 21:45.083
Why?

21:46.616 --> 21:47.416
Book.

22:27.539 --> 22:29.973
(Tee 0 - 1 Rodtang)
Fuse, that restaurant is good.

22:30.973 --> 22:31.773
Really?

22:35.506 --> 22:36.973
(Tee 1 - 1 Rodtang)
Careful, watch where you're walking.

22:38.593 --> 22:40.287
Nai, you okay?

22:40.830 --> 22:41.839
Wanna piggyback?

22:42.439 --> 22:43.239
My ass.

22:46.199 --> 22:48.465
Right, Nai.

22:49.243 --> 22:51.639
What happend to your leg?

22:53.199 --> 22:54.399
It's nothing much.

22:54.652 --> 22:55.786
Just something fell on me.

22:57.300 --> 22:59.389
Who patched you up?

22:59.650 --> 23:02.081
Hey, there is enough room for the four of us.
Let's head over.

23:02.106 --> 23:02.906
Come on.

23:02.906 --> 23:03.706
(Tee 1 -2 Rodtang)
Let's go.

23:03.707 --> 23:05.707
(Tee 1 - 2 Rodtang)

23:15.773 --> 23:17.906
(Tee 2 - 2 Rodtang)
It's too cold here. You'd better sit over there.

23:18.973 --> 23:20.039
I don't think so.

23:20.039 --> 23:21.573
(Tee 2 - 3 Rodtang)

23:23.939 --> 23:26.939
Well, I'll sit with Rodtang.

23:53.773 --> 23:55.273
Have you ever been to this restaurant?

23:59.773 --> 24:00.573
I've never been here.

24:00.573 --> 24:01.473
I'll order some food for you.

24:01.602 --> 24:03.602
(Tee 2 - 4 Rodtang)

24:06.339 --> 24:07.673
(Tee 3 - 4 Rodtang)
I'll take care of my person.

24:07.906 --> 24:09.573
(Tee 3 - 5 Rodtang)
Why? I want to order some food for Fuse.

24:09.574 --> 24:11.574
(Tee 3 - 5 Rodtang)

24:17.139 --> 24:20.873
Hey, we'll order some food for you two.

24:22.173 --> 24:23.173
You guys can wait here.

24:23.839 --> 24:24.639
Alright.

24:25.379 --> 24:26.179
Let's go, Tee.

24:44.539 --> 24:45.339
What's wrong?

24:50.466 --> 24:52.032
Don't you like Rodtang?

24:53.746 --> 24:55.313
He keeps hanging around you.

24:56.680 --> 24:58.246
Well, both of us are drum majors.

25:01.066 --> 25:02.499
I think he definitely likes you.

25:03.499 --> 25:05.699
Right, he told me that...

25:05.811 --> 25:06.963
he's a fan of mine.

25:07.243 --> 25:08.506
Because I'm handsome.

25:08.773 --> 25:10.302
Then he must be a fan of mine too.

25:11.266 --> 25:12.273
Because I'm more handsome than you.

25:13.339 --> 25:14.382
No way.

25:15.155 --> 25:17.490
Someone must think I'm more handsome than you.

25:18.826 --> 25:19.626
Nah.

25:20.473 --> 25:21.373
I think you're cute.

25:21.454 --> 25:23.454
(Tee + 1,000)

25:23.739 --> 25:24.673
What are you saying?

25:24.698 --> 25:26.132
Let's buy some food.

25:36.446 --> 25:37.512
I'm stuffed.

25:38.045 --> 25:40.090
Who said don't want to have it earlier.

25:40.219 --> 25:41.052
You stole all my food.

25:42.126 --> 25:43.026
How do you guys get home?

25:43.146 --> 25:44.012
I'll take the BTS.

25:44.446 --> 25:45.246
Me too.

25:47.146 --> 25:47.946
Fine.

25:48.312 --> 25:49.546
What about you, Fuse?

25:50.379 --> 25:51.646
I'll take the bus.

25:52.612 --> 25:54.912
Let's split up here.

25:55.212 --> 25:56.212
Goodbye.

25:56.212 --> 25:56.712
Bye.

25:56.812 --> 25:57.579
See you.

25:57.579 --> 25:58.612
See you.

26:01.112 --> 26:01.979
Let's go.

26:11.412 --> 26:12.312
Are you okay?

26:14.046 --> 26:14.846
I'm okay.

26:15.012 --> 26:15.912
Wanna piggyback?

26:16.912 --> 26:17.712
I'm good.

26:18.346 --> 26:18.846
You sure?

26:18.846 --> 26:19.579
Yeah.

26:33.546 --> 26:35.066
I want you to take a break.

26:35.066 --> 26:35.812
Otherwise your wound might tear open.

26:36.512 --> 26:37.528
It's fine.

26:37.528 --> 26:39.104
It just feels a bit tight.

26:39.104 --> 26:41.512
I think it'll be fine by tomorrow.

26:46.446 --> 26:49.046
Let's call a temporary truce.

26:50.946 --> 26:51.746
Fine.

26:55.379 --> 26:58.401
Fuse and I practiced well today.

26:58.501 --> 27:00.279
No need to worry.

27:01.233 --> 27:02.533
If you guys practice,

27:02.579 --> 27:03.379
I won't be worried at all.

27:03.779 --> 27:05.312
But one try to come to Siam,

27:05.712 --> 27:06.979
and the other try to leave to meet a partner.

27:08.179 --> 27:09.712
Does Fuse have his happiness?

27:11.046 --> 27:11.846
What?

27:12.012 --> 27:12.812
His happiness.

27:15.446 --> 27:17.546
When you're happy being with someone,

27:18.572 --> 27:19.396
that person is your happiness.

27:21.550 --> 27:22.754
Do you mean a partner?

27:22.779 --> 27:25.246
Hey, I'm too young to know this stuff.

27:26.652 --> 27:27.582
Fine.

27:27.642 --> 27:29.312
Does Fuse have it? Who is his partner?

27:30.172 --> 27:30.972
I don't know.

27:31.346 --> 27:33.179
All I know is his partner goes to the other school.

27:33.446 --> 27:35.146
And that person is freaking pretty.

27:36.012 --> 27:36.812
Is his partner a girl?

27:37.646 --> 27:38.193
Why?

27:38.193 --> 27:39.835
I thought it's Tee.

27:39.835 --> 27:40.335
Huh?

27:40.646 --> 27:41.546
Tee?

27:41.646 --> 27:42.812
Didn't you see?

27:43.446 --> 27:45.312
Tee acted like a gatekeeper.

27:45.446 --> 27:46.746
I couldn't even get near Fuse.

27:47.779 --> 27:48.779
Wasn't he just teasing you?

27:49.512 --> 27:50.379
I doubt it.

27:52.046 --> 27:52.846
Well.

27:53.246 --> 27:54.046
What about you?

27:54.746 --> 27:55.546
Do you have a partner?

27:57.346 --> 27:58.146
Fine.

27:59.779 --> 28:01.912
Do you have your happiness?

28:05.712 --> 28:07.446
Why? You don't like anyone?

28:08.018 --> 28:11.976
Well, I like cute person and I like Fuse too.

28:13.579 --> 28:16.412
So, do you prefer men or women?

28:16.646 --> 28:19.312
These days, you can like whoever you want.

28:20.146 --> 28:22.146
I like whoever catches my eyes.

28:23.499 --> 28:25.266
That's great.

28:27.112 --> 28:28.112
Do you feel better now?

28:28.379 --> 28:29.179
Yeah.

28:31.226 --> 28:32.626
Which station do you get off at?

28:32.946 --> 28:33.967
Saint Louis station.

28:34.027 --> 28:34.639
Oh.

28:35.146 --> 28:35.946
Me too.

28:36.946 --> 28:37.746
Which alley?

28:39.001 --> 28:40.467
The alley that has a goddess shrine.

28:40.492 --> 28:41.592
Hey, me too.

28:42.139 --> 28:43.239
For real?

28:43.846 --> 28:45.546
I'll come and hang out at your place a lot then.

28:45.979 --> 28:48.446
Hang out? My house is not a kid playground.

28:57.815 --> 28:59.042
Guys.

28:59.363 --> 29:01.660
You are very attentive in class today,

29:01.660 --> 29:03.990
so I won't give any homework.

29:09.381 --> 29:11.450
Alright.

29:11.717 --> 29:12.217
Teacher.

29:12.217 --> 29:12.814
Yes?

29:12.814 --> 29:13.551
What time is it?

29:14.317 --> 29:15.151
Uh-oh.

29:15.351 --> 29:16.151
It's already 12 PM.

29:16.617 --> 29:17.210
Oh.

29:17.210 --> 29:18.251
I'm hungry.

29:19.017 --> 29:21.051
Well, let's take a lunch break.

29:21.270 --> 29:24.470
Yay!

29:25.951 --> 29:27.884
Fuse, how about some Mala today?

29:28.017 --> 29:29.151
I have a practice.

29:31.151 --> 29:32.177
Again?

29:32.486 --> 29:33.651
You practice everyday.

29:34.017 --> 29:35.693
It won't hurt to miss a practice just one day.

29:36.108 --> 29:38.867
Being this hard-working is not yourself at all.

29:38.892 --> 29:40.091
It's okay to take a break.

29:46.485 --> 29:50.258
(Can we meet at your school this evening?
I want to watch you practice.)

29:55.322 --> 29:58.336
(I probably not practice today.)

29:59.078 --> 30:06.132
(Oh, I already ditched my friends' movie plan.)

30:15.610 --> 30:17.344
Hey, Fuse.

30:35.417 --> 30:36.217
Hey.

30:36.850 --> 30:38.617
What's Robert's problem this time?

30:41.017 --> 30:42.417
He wants to break up with his girlfriend.

30:43.817 --> 30:45.117
Did he just realize that?

30:50.450 --> 30:51.450
He realized it for a while,

30:52.717 --> 30:54.283
but had no chance to do it.

30:56.084 --> 30:58.517
So, what will you do next?

31:03.183 --> 31:04.583
I need to break up with her.

31:05.976 --> 31:07.676
It's starting to be unfair to her.

31:11.043 --> 31:12.077
I do understand that...

31:12.290 --> 31:13.924
she's done something unfair to you first.

31:14.630 --> 31:16.430
But you shouldn't have done it like her.

31:22.456 --> 31:24.827
Sort this out so your mind is at ease.

31:25.705 --> 31:28.290
Being two-timing isn't cool at all.

31:32.796 --> 31:34.392
Hey, not me.

31:35.023 --> 31:38.014
I forgot, I mean Robert.

31:38.039 --> 31:38.965
Um.

31:39.056 --> 31:40.726
Okay.

31:41.278 --> 31:42.582
I'll go back to our room, Fuse.

31:42.639 --> 31:45.752
My bad, Robert Sae-tang.

32:36.000 --> 32:36.500
Frame.

32:36.500 --> 32:36.923
Huh?

32:36.948 --> 32:37.530
Help me.

32:37.857 --> 32:38.542
Don't.

32:38.567 --> 32:39.267
Help you?

32:39.267 --> 32:40.767
He is stealing my instant noodles.

32:40.867 --> 32:42.367
I can't even help myself.

32:42.975 --> 32:43.942
Do you need any help?

32:43.967 --> 32:45.587
Help me? Just stop it.

32:45.669 --> 32:46.049
What?

32:46.074 --> 32:47.942
See? He's about to eat it.

32:48.992 --> 32:50.726
Do you follow BKBOii?

32:51.247 --> 32:53.580
Yeah, he's freaking sexy.

32:53.633 --> 32:55.400
Do you know that he goes to our school?

32:55.425 --> 32:56.225
Huh?

32:56.800 --> 32:57.600
Who is he?

32:58.179 --> 33:00.979
I don't know either. I'll look into it.

33:26.006 --> 33:26.806
Why did you come outside?

33:28.526 --> 33:29.559
Why did you follow me?

33:30.600 --> 33:32.300
I told you not to talk to me at school.

33:32.600 --> 33:33.667
Is it still in effect?

33:34.973 --> 33:36.746
Why can we talk anywhere else,

33:37.767 --> 33:39.200
but we can't talk here?

33:40.492 --> 33:41.525
Then just don't talk to me.

33:43.039 --> 33:46.105
Anywhere. Leave me alone.

33:58.633 --> 33:59.433
Hey.

34:14.659 --> 34:15.459
Fuse.

34:17.080 --> 34:17.946
Have you been waiting for a while?

34:20.886 --> 34:22.486
What did you buy?

34:24.153 --> 34:27.386
Just in case you're hungry after practice.

34:28.920 --> 34:29.720
Really?

34:30.586 --> 34:32.886
But if you're not hungry, I'll have it.

34:33.780 --> 34:34.987
Um.

34:35.566 --> 34:36.366
Um.

34:39.245 --> 34:40.079
It looks yummy.

34:41.652 --> 34:43.452
You look like you don't really want to eat.

34:44.406 --> 34:45.273
Tee.

34:46.020 --> 34:46.820
Oh.

34:46.953 --> 34:48.020
We bought the same thing.

34:48.286 --> 34:49.086
It's yummy, right?

34:49.820 --> 34:50.620
Um.

34:50.786 --> 34:53.086
Did you buy it for Fuse?

34:58.052 --> 34:58.852
Really?

34:59.145 --> 35:01.132
You're so kind.

35:01.546 --> 35:03.112
Let me see what you bought.

35:04.420 --> 35:07.065
Wow, you actually got this one?

35:07.090 --> 35:08.745
They're all gone when I went to get it.

35:08.932 --> 35:10.832
I bet you probably bought them all.

35:20.270 --> 35:23.336
Wow, my school is nothing like this.

35:25.870 --> 35:26.936
You mean the smells?

35:30.681 --> 35:33.215
Except Tee.

35:33.240 --> 35:34.721
Because Tee smells so good.

35:37.615 --> 35:38.415
What about me?

35:44.703 --> 35:47.170
Fuse, I'll leave him to you.

35:47.774 --> 35:48.574
Got it.

35:48.606 --> 35:49.406
As you like.

36:04.346 --> 36:05.207
Fire! Rodtang!

36:05.207 --> 36:06.479
Gosh, fire!

36:06.504 --> 36:07.304
Where is the water?

36:07.329 --> 36:08.279
Put out the fire quickly!

36:10.885 --> 36:12.219
Fuse, are you teasing me?

36:13.817 --> 36:14.758
Um.

36:15.579 --> 36:16.613
Because you slept.

36:18.746 --> 36:20.213
Well, you teased me.

36:20.946 --> 36:21.746
Um.

36:23.313 --> 36:24.113
Alright.

36:25.079 --> 36:26.146
Fuse, who is she?

36:30.079 --> 36:31.279
Is she Tee's girlfriend?

36:34.305 --> 36:36.039
Hey, she's my girlfriend.

36:36.985 --> 36:39.158
Oh, hello.

36:43.985 --> 36:44.785
How cute.

36:47.313 --> 36:48.346
This is Jeen.

36:50.513 --> 36:51.579
And this is Rodtang.

36:51.879 --> 36:53.339
The head drum major of our school.

36:53.370 --> 36:54.338
Wow.

36:54.605 --> 36:55.438
You're so talented.

36:56.213 --> 36:57.013
Not at all.

36:57.199 --> 36:57.999
I'm just handsome.

36:58.713 --> 37:00.546
Hey, come over here.

37:00.746 --> 37:01.622
Let's practice.

37:01.622 --> 37:02.413
Bring your mace.

37:03.679 --> 37:04.479
Excuse me.

37:04.665 --> 37:05.465
It's fine.

37:18.718 --> 37:20.318
Tee, please take care of Jeen.

37:49.313 --> 37:51.413
I've seen your happiness for the first time.

37:52.192 --> 37:53.359
She's so cute.

37:56.259 --> 37:57.059
What did you say again?

37:57.191 --> 37:58.058
Your happiness.

38:01.452 --> 38:02.252
What do you mean?

38:04.113 --> 38:05.237
When you're happy with someone,

38:05.702 --> 38:07.744
that person is your happiness.

38:10.364 --> 38:11.764
What if I'm not happy?

38:11.992 --> 38:13.924
Oh, you're not happy?

38:14.453 --> 38:15.572
Uh.

38:17.865 --> 38:18.665
I'm just asking.

38:22.613 --> 38:25.003
You have to hold it like this to get a better grip.

38:25.687 --> 38:27.630
And making your arms like this.

38:27.965 --> 38:29.054
Sort this out

38:29.308 --> 38:30.809
so your mind is at ease.

38:31.946 --> 38:33.934
Being two-timing isn't cool at all.

38:39.152 --> 38:42.915
Fuse, I got it.

38:43.961 --> 38:46.754
You must not looking at
your happiness so that you can focus.

38:46.846 --> 38:49.055
Turn this way.

38:49.256 --> 38:50.577
I'll get you a mace.

39:14.579 --> 39:15.413
Tee, you know what.

39:15.913 --> 39:17.713
I've never seen Fuse being a drum major.

39:18.565 --> 39:19.831
Have you ever seen it?

39:22.552 --> 39:23.652
He looks so cool.

39:25.498 --> 39:27.348
Good thing is there is no girls in this school.

39:27.979 --> 39:31.295
If there were, it would bummed me out.

39:33.258 --> 39:34.058
Why?

39:34.919 --> 39:37.566
I'm afraid somone will take Fuse away from me.

39:38.652 --> 39:43.237
It's a relief that there are only men here.

39:46.446 --> 39:48.962
You're so cool, Fuse.

40:38.886 --> 40:40.052
Have you finished the practice?

40:41.187 --> 40:41.987
Um.

40:43.593 --> 40:46.259
Great. My mom just called me to come home.

40:48.434 --> 40:50.634
Is Tee going straight home?

40:52.119 --> 40:54.919
Yeah, he is going home with me.

40:58.060 --> 41:02.139
Okay, I have to go now.

41:02.739 --> 41:04.958
Don't forget the snacks. Bye.

41:19.126 --> 41:20.692
How was your talk with Jeen?

41:22.859 --> 41:23.692
It was fun.

41:25.626 --> 41:26.826
She's talkative.

41:30.526 --> 41:32.492
You can pretend to sleep next time.

41:35.326 --> 41:36.726
Will there be next time?

41:43.792 --> 41:44.429
But...

41:45.255 --> 41:48.243
Jeen is lovely. She seems to like you a lot.

41:51.059 --> 41:53.392
You didn't get that matter wrong, did you?

41:55.092 --> 41:56.692
You guys should talk things out nicely.

41:59.592 --> 42:01.926
I don't think that would help.

42:10.992 --> 42:12.892
It's not about her now.

42:16.392 --> 42:17.259
It's my fault.

42:26.526 --> 42:30.826
I think I'll break up with her.

43:17.192 --> 43:18.126
In a few hours,

43:18.292 --> 43:20.326
the friendly match will start.

43:20.526 --> 43:23.659
Let's team up. One, two, three.

43:25.859 --> 43:27.092
Aren't you a bit too handsome today?

43:27.518 --> 43:29.552
I think I'm handsome everyday.

43:29.912 --> 43:31.746
Can I persue you, the head of cheer club?

43:32.092 --> 43:33.326
Why don't you sit with your friends?

43:33.492 --> 43:34.592
I want to sit here.

43:34.792 --> 43:35.892
Can I sit here?
